# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fire Opal Performance Management makes it simple for anyone to achieve "
"meaningful results from quantum computers at scale without needing to be "
"quantum hardware experts. When running circuits with Fire Opal Performance "
"Management, AI-driven error suppression techniques are automatically "
"applied, enabling the scaling of larger problems with more gates and qubits."
" This approach reduces the number of shots required to reach the correct "
"answer, with no added overhead — resulting in significant savings in both "
"compute time and cost.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagawa ng Fire Opal Performance Management na simple para sa sinuman na "
"makamit ang makabuluhang resulta mula sa mga quantum computer sa malaking "
"sukat nang hindi kailangang maging eksperto sa quantum hardware. Kapag "
"nagpapatakbo ng mga circuit gamit ang Fire Opal Performance Management, "
"awtomatikong inilalapat ang mga AI-driven na teknik ng error suppression, na"
" nagbibigay-daan sa pag-scale ng mas malalaking problema na may mas maraming"
" gate at qubit. Binabawasan ng approach na ito ang bilang ng mga shot na "
"kailangan para makamit ang tamang sagot, nang walang dagdag na overhead — na"
" nagresulta sa malaking tipid sa oras ng computation at gastos.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Performance Management suppresses errors and increases the probability of "
"getting the correct answer on noisy hardware. In other words, it increases "
"the signal-to-noise ratio. The following image shows how increased accuracy "
"enabled by Performance Management can reduce the need for additional shots "
"in the case of a 10-qubit Quantum Fourier Transform algorithm. With only 30 "
"shots, Q-CTRL reaches the 99% confidence threshold, whereas the default "
"(`QiskitRuntime` Sampler, `optimization_level`=3 and `resilience_level`=1, "
"`ibm_sherbrooke`) requires 170,000 shots. By getting the right answer "
"faster, you save significant compute runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sinusupress ng Performance Management ang mga error at pinapataas ang "
"posibilidad na makuha ang tamang sagot sa maingay na hardware. Sa madaling "
"salita, pinapataas nito ang signal-to-noise ratio. Ipinapakita ng sumusunod "
"na larawan kung paano maaaring bawasan ng mas mataas na katumpakan na "
"pinapagana ng Performance Management ang pangangailangan para sa karagdagang"
" mga shot sa kaso ng isang 10-qubit Quantum Fourier Transform algorithm. Sa "
"30 shot lamang, naabot ng Q-CTRL ang 99% confidence threshold, samantalang "
"ang default (`QiskitRuntime` Sampler, `optimization_level`=3 at "
"`resilience_level`=1, `ibm_sherbrooke`) ay nangangailangan ng 170,000 shot. "
"Sa pamamagitan ng pagkuha ng tamang sagot nang mas mabilis, makakatipid ka "
"ng malaking oras ng computation.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Visualization of the improved runtime](/docs/images/guides/qctrl-"
"performance-management/achieve_more.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Visualization ng pinahusay na runtime](/docs/images/guides/qctrl-"
"performance-management/achieve_more.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Performance Management function can be used with any algorithm, and you "
"can easily use it in place of the standard [Qiskit Runtime "
"primitives](/guides/primitives). Behind the scenes, multiple error "
"suppression techniques work together to prevent errors from happening at "
"runtime. All Fire Opal pipeline methods are pre-configured and algorithm-"
"agnostic, meaning you always get the best performance out of the box.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaaring gamitin ang Performance Management function sa anumang algorithm, "
"at madali mo itong magagamit bilang kapalit ng mga standard na [Qiskit "
"Runtime primitives](/guides/primitives). Sa likod ng eksena, maraming teknik"
" ng error suppression ang nagtatrabaho nang sabay-sabay upang maiwasan ang "
"mga error sa runtime. Lahat ng Fire Opal pipeline method ay pre-configured "
"at algorithm-agnostic, ibig sabihin palagi kang makakakuha ng pinakamahusay "
"na performance nang walang karagdagang configuration.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To get access to Performance Management, [contact "
"Q-CTRL](https://form.typeform.com/to/uOAVDnGg?typeform-source=q-ctrl.com).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makakuha ng access sa Performance Management, [makipag-ugnayan sa "
"Q-CTRL](https://form.typeform.com/to/uOAVDnGg?typeform-source=q-ctrl.com).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Description {#description}"
msgstr "Paglalarawan {#description}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fire Opal Performance Management has two options for execution that are similar to the Qiskit Runtime primitives, so you can easily swap in the Q-CTRL Sampler and Estimator. The general workflow for using the Performance Management function is:\n"
"1. Define your circuit (and operators in the case of the Estimator).\n"
"2. Run the circuit.\n"
"3. Retrieve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Fire Opal Performance Management ay may dalawang opsyon para sa pagpapatakbo na katulad ng mga Qiskit Runtime primitives, kaya madali mong mapapalitan ng Q-CTRL Sampler at Estimator. Ang pangkalahatang workflow para sa paggamit ng Performance Management function ay:\n"
"1. Tukuyin ang iyong circuit (at mga operator sa kaso ng Estimator).\n"
"2. Patakbuhin ang circuit.\n"
"3. Kunin ang mga resulta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To reduce hardware noise, Fire Opal employs a range of AI-driven error "
"suppression techniques depicted in the following image. With Fire Opal, the "
"entire pipeline is completely automated with zero need for configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para bawasan ang ingay ng hardware, gumagamit ang Fire Opal ng iba't ibang "
"AI-driven na teknik ng error suppression na ipinapakita sa sumusunod na "
"larawan. Sa Fire Opal, ang buong pipeline ay ganap na automated nang walang "
"pangangailangan para sa configuration.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fire Opal's pipeline eliminates the need for additional overhead, such as "
"increased quantum runtime or extra physical qubits. Note that classical "
"processing time remains a factor (refer to the [Benchmarks](#benchmarks) "
"section for estimates, where \"Total time\" reflects both classical and "
"quantum processing). In contrast to error mitigation, which requires "
"overhead in the form of sampling, Fire Opal's error suppression works at "
"both the gate and pulse levels to address various sources of noise and to "
"prevent the likelihood of an error occurring. By preventing errors, the need"
" for expensive post-processing is eliminated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inaalis ng pipeline ng Fire Opal ang pangangailangan para sa karagdagang "
"overhead, tulad ng karagdagang quantum runtime o dagdag na pisikal na qubit."
" Tandaan na ang classical processing time ay nananatiling isang salik "
"(sumangguni sa seksyon ng [Mga Benchmark](#benchmarks) para sa mga "
"pagtatantya, kung saan ang \"Total time\" ay sumasalamin sa parehong "
"classical at quantum processing). Kumpara sa error mitigation, na "
"nangangailangan ng overhead sa anyo ng sampling, ang error suppression ng "
"Fire Opal ay gumagana sa parehong gate at pulse na antas upang tugunan ang "
"iba't ibang pinagkukunan ng ingay at upang maiwasan ang posibilidad ng "
"paglitaw ng error. Sa pamamagitan ng pag-iwas sa mga error, naaalis ang "
"pangangailangan para sa mahal na post-processing.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following image depicts the error suppression methods automated by Fire "
"Opal Performance Management.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng sumusunod na larawan ang mga paraan ng error suppression na "
"na-automate ng Fire Opal Performance Management.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Visualization of the error suppression "
"pipeline](/docs/images/guides/qctrl-performance-"
"management/error_suppression.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Visualization ng error suppression pipeline](/docs/images/guides/qctrl-"
"performance-management/error_suppression.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The function offers two primitives, Sampler and Estimator, and the inputs "
"and outputs of both extend the implemented spec for [Qiskit Runtime V2 "
"primitives](/guides/primitive-input-output#pubs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Nag-aalok ang function ng dalawang primitive, Sampler at Estimator, at ang "
"mga input at output ng pareho ay nagpapalawak ng implemented spec para sa "
"[Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/primitive-input-output#pubs).\n"

