# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Fire Opal Performance Management's Sampler primitive to run a Bernstein–Vazirani circuit. This algorithm, used to find a hidden string from the outputs of a black box function, is a common benchmarking algorithm because there is a single correct answer.\n"
"**1. Create the circuit**\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang Sampler primitive ng Fire Opal Performance Management para "
"patakbuhin ang isang Bernstein–Vazirani circuit. Ang algorithm na ito, na "
"ginagamit para hanapin ang isang nakatagong string mula sa mga output ng "
"isang black box function, ay isang karaniwang benchmarking algorithm dahil "
"mayroon itong isang tamang sagot.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define the correct answer to the algorithm, the hidden bitstring, and the "
"Bernstein–Vazirani circuit. You can adjust the width of the circuit by "
"simply changing the `circuit_width`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tukuyin ang tamang sagot sa algorithm, ang nakatagong bitstring, at ang "
"Bernstein–Vazirani circuit. Maaari mong ayusin ang lapad ng circuit sa "
"pamamagitan lamang ng pagbabago ng `circuit_width`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check your Qiskit Function workload's [status](/guides/functions#check-job-"
"status) or return [results](/guides/functions#retrieve-results) as "
"follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Suriin ang [status](/guides/functions#check-job-status) ng iyong Qiskit "
"Function workload o kunin ang [mga resulta](/guides/functions#retrieve-"
"results) tulad ng sumusunod:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**3. Plot the top bitstrings**\n"
msgstr "**3. I-plot ang mga nangungunang bitstring**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the bitstring with the highest counts to see if the hidden bitstring "
"was the mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-plot ang bitstring na may pinakamataas na bilang para makita kung ang "
"nakatagong bitstring ang mode.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The hidden bitstring is highlighted in purple, and it should be the "
"bitstring with the highest number of counts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang nakatagong bitstring ay naka-highlight sa kulay lila, at dapat itong ang"
" bitstring na may pinakamataas na bilang ng counts.\n"

